            <ArticleTitle>Character of headache in Kimmerle anomaly.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>911-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Kimmerle anomaly may be associated with a variety of neurological symptoms. We sought to determine the prevalence and character of these symptoms in a large cohort of afflicted patients.</AbstractText>
